  "description": "Bilinear minification of an sRGB bitmap (phase1.15_compositor-colour-fits item 2.5, decision 174 item 6), under Legacy on the authored 4x2 plane grid at 256 px. One fill per set with only BaseColor (sRGB8) active, its source a bitmap set to sRGB, UV projection with wrap Repeat, rotation 0, offset (0, 0): the 8-bit srgb8-ramp on s0-s3 and field A (16-bit) on s4-s7; per source BilinearHQ at scale (2, 2) and (4, 4), then BilinearSharp at (2, 2) and (4, 4). BaseColor at PNG 16, PNG 8 and OpenEXR 32f, infinite padding, no dithering, every export step done twice in the session.",
